    {
        "text": "A counter of black."
    },
    {
        "text": "All things have their needs. These waregeists' dispositions correspond with the 'desires' of the wares."
    },
    {
        "text": "So, the ones who roused me..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it my young sister who hunches over scrolls splashing ink into scapes, or that young sister in words of gold, who makes it so when she speaks?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Was it only him as he threw a piece down, with a momentary clack?"
