    {
        "text": "Good technique! Seems you didn't just stay an innkeeper all these years!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I really haven't used it since then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm used to counting my chips, sorting out my needs... I never thought I'd still be so able with this frostblade of mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's surprising.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What would winning or losing even mean, if I met a Zheng Qingyue depressed and joyless? It hung on my mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems heaven must have willed this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
        "fadetime": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Heaven who? You're just obsessed with getting revenge!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Du"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Urgh...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ye! Don't interfere! Go after that Lungmenite, and find the goblet!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_296_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, dad, but you're not in charge here now\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Du"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
