    },
    {
        "text": "Er, let's not be too hasty with the rocks now. Pull any more away and we'll be stranded up here, wouldn't you say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#11$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The struggling of the cornered.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#11$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Benefactor! I'll hold out here! You go help Brother Lee! Don't let that kid get away with it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right! You watch yourself!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, you really must stop with the bullying here. The only reason I've not kicked into action is because you're a mandarin, after all\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I repay Lord Zuo's patronage. I go with him. My status has nothing to do with this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Come! Disciple of Lien, you and I contest purely as martial men. We shall test each other.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, don't mind if I do!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
